          | other variables                    |
global -->|                                    |
env       | square: --+                        |
          +-----------|---------------------+--+
                      |       ^             ^
square(5L)           |       |             |
                      V       |             |
                  .---.---.   |         +---+--+
                  | O | O-+---+   E1 -->| x: 5 |
                  `-|-^---'             +------+
                    |
                    V
                  parameters: x
                  body: x * x
@end example
@end quotation
@end ifinfo
@ifhtml
@image{../../text/original/figures/chap3/Fig3.3b,,129mm,Figure 3.3: Environment created by evaluating square(5L) in the global environment.,.std.svg}
@end ifhtml
