                 |       +--------------+  |       +--------------+
                 |  E1 ->| balance: 100 |  |  E2 ->| balance: 100 |
                 |       | b: 50        |  |       | b: 100       |
                 |       +--------------+  |       +--------------+
                 V              ^         V              ^
             .---.---.          |     .---.---.          |
             | O | O-+----------+     | O | O-+----------+
             `-|-^---'                `-|-^---'
